  "sourceTitle": "Nothing Soup",
  "sourceText": "Nothing Soup\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 16, 2009 - 11:49pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 onion, chopped\n1 clove garlic, smashed\n4 ounces carrots, chopped\n4 ounces celery, chopped\n4 tablespoons Parmesan cheese\n1/4 teaspoon butter\n1 1/2 cups water\n16 ounces potatoes, chopped\n1 stalk and leaves of parsley\n1/4 teaspoon pepper\n1 1/2 teaspoons salt\n2 cups milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Saute onion, garlic, carrot, and celery in butter until semi-tender. Add water, potatoes, parsley, thyme, salt, and pepper; cook 15 minutes. Add milk and cheese; heat until almost boiling.",
